{
  "about": "The digests `pact discover` prints for trees in this repository: the tree's own `digest`, and each workflow's `doc-digest` (what a waiting run is pinned to) and `contract-digest` (what its callers rely on), 02W §7.2. A digest is a function of the tree's files and of nothing else: a new version of PACT prints the same digest for the same files, or says in its changelog which trees move and why. Held by crates/pact-cli/tests/a_digest_moves_only_when_the_tree_does.rs. A runtime that pins PACT holds this file with one `pact discover` per tree, at every pin.",
